<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>FalconX | Payment Project</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1020;
      color: #f4f7ff;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      padding: 22px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #26304a;
    }

    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #78b7ff; }

    nav a {
      color: #dce6f7;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 18px;
    }

    main { max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; padding: 70px 8%; }

    .hero { text-align: center; padding: 45px 0; }

    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 64px); margin: 0 0 16px; }

    .hero p { color: #b9c5dc; max-width: 650px; margin: auto; }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #2878e5;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      margin-top: 45px;
      padding: 26px;
      background: #131c31;
      border: 1px solid #26304a;
      border-radius: 14px;
    }

    h2 { color: #78b7ff; }

    .notice { color: #b9c5dc; font-size: 14px; }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #9aa9c3;
      border-top: 1px solid #26304a;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header { align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; flex-direction: column; }
      nav a { margin: 0 14px 0 0; }
      main { padding-top: 35px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">FalconX</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#token">Token</a>
      <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Payments, made simple.</h1>
      <p>
        FalconX is a proposed blockchain payment project exploring
        ways to make digital payments easier to understand and use.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#about">Explore the project</a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>About FalconX</h2>
      <p>
        Our goal is to research and develop a digital payment system
        using blockchain technology. The project is still under development.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="token">
      <h2>FLX Token</h2>
      <p><strong>Planned network:</strong> BNB Smart Chain</p>
      <p><strong>Proposed total supply:</strong> 1,000,000,000 FLX</p>
      <p class="notice">
        These are proposed details. The token has not been confirmed
        as launched on the mainnet.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="roadmap">
      <h2>Roadmap</h2>
      <p>1. Learn and develop the project concept.</p>
      <p>2. Build and test a prototype on a test network.</p>
      <p>3. Review security and project requirements.</p>
      <p>4. Consider future development based on testing and review.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    FalconX Project — Under development
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
